{"seq":1,"slug":"systems-engineering-grad","title":"系统工程","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad","introMarkdown":"# 系统工程 简介\n\n系统工程是一门以整体论视角处理复杂工程问题的跨学科方法论，关注如何设计、集成和管理复杂系统的全生命周期。研究生阶段的系统工程学习要求从单一技术视角跃升到系统层面的综合思维，在不确定性和多目标约束下做出有效决策。\n\n本课程设置四个章节，从理论基础到前沿领域逐步深入。第一章**系统工程基础**建立学科的认识论和方法论框架，涵盖工程中的系统思维、需求工程和系统架构设计三个核心议题，帮助学习者理解如何从利益相关者需求出发构建完整的系统方案。第二章**系统建模与仿真**聚焦用数学和计算模型描述复杂系统行为的方法，介绍基于模型的系统工程、离散事件仿真和基于智能体的建模三种主流建模范式。第三章**系统优化**深入多目标优化、可靠性工程和决策分析三个方向，展示如何在多种约束和不确定性条件下寻找最优或满意的系统方案。第四章**复杂系统工程**面向当代工程系统的复杂性挑战，探讨信息物理系统、体系工程和韧性工程等前沿议题。\n\n建议学习者在学习过程中选取一个实际工程案例作为贯穿线索，将各章节的方法论应用于同一案例的不同分析维度。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"系统工程基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"systems-thinking-engineering","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 工程中的系统思维","url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/foundations/systems-thinking-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"requirements-engineering","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 需求工程","url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/foundations/requirements-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"system-architecture","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 系统架构设计","url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/foundations/system-architecture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"modeling","title":"系统建模与仿真","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/modeling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"model-based-engineering","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 基于模型的系统工程","url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/modeling/model-based-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"discrete-event-simulation","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 离散事件仿真","url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/modeling/discrete-event-simulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"agent-based-modeling","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 基于智能体的建模","url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/modeling/agent-based-modeling"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"optimization","title":"系统优化","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-objective-optimization","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 多目标优化","url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/optimization/multi-objective-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reliability-engineering","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 可靠性工程","url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/optimization/reliability-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"decision-analysis","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 决策分析","url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/optimization/decision-analysis"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"complex-systems","title":"复杂系统工程","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/complex-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cyber-physical-systems","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 信息物理系统","url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/complex-systems/cyber-physical-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"system-of-systems","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 体系工程","url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/complex-systems/system-of-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"resilience-engineering","title":"研究生 系统工程 — 韧性工程","url":"/education/graduate/engineering/systems-engineering-grad/complex-systems/resilience-engineering"}]}]}